	"The alarm rings. The ordinary car comes to the recall floor, opens, and then will not take passenger calls. That is Phase I. It is not a way out, and it is not the firefighters driving the car.": "Suena la alarma. La cabina normal llega a la planta de retorno, abre y luego no acepta llamadas de pasajeros. Eso es Phase I. No es una salida, y no son los bomberos conduciendo la cabina.",
